        <mxCell id="MCU3RolZ979tPYoSzu-l-2" value="Perform setup tasks for CAN communication, including:&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Setting initial values for status, rear left or rear right messages, depending on which node it is&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Resetting the CAN controller&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Setting the bitrate and oscillator configurations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Setting normal mode on CAN controller&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="MCU3RolZ979tPYoSzu-l-13" vertex="1">
