        <mxCell id="MCU3RolZ979tPYoSzu-l-22" value="&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Set the pin modes for the various Arduino pins used to interface with the ESC of the wheel, such as:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;throttle pins&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;reverse pins&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;boost pins&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Eco pins&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Regen pins&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pulse pins&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;Attach the pulse pins to the interrupt service routine (ISR) pulseISR&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="MCU3RolZ979tPYoSzu-l-13" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="220" width="260" height="194.64" as="geometry" />
